{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "旧路径 → 新路径的迁移表。metric 脚本按两个被测提交检测 from/to 是否存在，输出 moved/pending/both/neither，避免把搬目录当成复杂度消除。",
  "entries": [
    {
      "from": "src/domain/SvgDocument.ts",
      "to": "packages/core/domain/SvgDocument.ts",
      "kind": "file",
      "fromCategory": "kernel",
      "toCategory": "kernel",
      "note": "文档校验与克隆能力保留，校验改为多态不变量"
    },
    {
      "from": "src/domain/shapes/Shape.ts",
      "to": "packages/core/domain/Shape.ts",
      "kind": "file",
      "fromCategory": "kernel",
      "toCategory": "kernel",
      "note": "基础形状多态仍属内核"
    },
    {
      "from": "src/domain/shapes/Group.ts",
      "to": "packages/core/domain/ContainerShape.ts",
      "kind": "file",
      "fromCategory": "kernel",
      "toCategory": "kernel",
      "note": "容器能力抽为公开抽象"
    },
    {
      "from": "src/application/ports",
      "to": "packages/core/ports",
      "kind": "directory",
      "fromCategory": "kernel",
      "toCategory": "kernel",
      "note": "端口改为 core 公开契约"
    },
    {
      "from": "src/application/CommandHistory.ts",
